(7036725, 1069111, 86447, '<td valign="top">The challenge was to "Take an ordinary cardboard box in any size and use it to come up with a creative image."<br/> <br/>I don''t see an ordinary cardboard box.<br/> <br/>I do see the ingredients for it... but no box.  <br/> <br/>To me, it''s like having an automobile challenge and showing me a rubber tree.<br/> <br/>It''s a DNMC image to me... no matter HOW beautiful that rainbow is!  LOL!</td>', 'The challenge was to "Take an ordinary cardboard box in any size and use it to come up with a creative image." I don''t see an ordinary cardboard box. I do see the ingredients for it... but no box.   To me, it''s like having an automobile challenge and showing me a rubber tree. It''s a DNMC image to me... no matter HOW beautiful that rainbow is!  LOL!', '2013-05-13 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
